{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2c926760-58d6-853b-a6cb-9af6714d8e7f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T08:52:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carol Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:48:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin? My name is Carol Gardiner? I'm calling about a storm drain on my street? It's, um, 434 Ayrault Street, up on the Hill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:48:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 434 Ayrault. Got it. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:48:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's gurgling? Like, really loud, bubbling up? And there's this sewer smell coming out of it? It's been going since the rain that ended yesterday, the soaker? And it's not stopping?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:48:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gurgling and a sewer smell, okay. Is there water standing over the drain, or is it just the noise and the odor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:48:54-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's water pooling around it, like across half the road? And cars are slowing to a crawl to get through it? Because nobody wants to splash through that? I watched, like, six of them creep by this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:49:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll back things up on a narrow street. Is the water coming up out of the grate, or is it just collecting around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:49:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, both, kind of? It's coming up a little, I think? And then it just sits? And honestly this isn't the first time it's done this? It just gets ignored?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry about that. I'm writing this down: 434 Ayrault Street, storm drain gurgling, sewage odor, water pooling into the road, traffic slowing. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:49:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes? That's it? So will somebody actually open a work order for this? And, like, for what date? Because I need a day, not just, we'll look into it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll open the work order right now while we're talking. As for the date, the crews are working through a pile of calls after that storm, so I'd tell you early next week is the realistic window. I'll mark it as a drain backing up into the road so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early next week? Okay? It's just, my youngest starts preschool in January? And we're walking that street every morning? So I'd really like it not to smell like a sewer by then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:50:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Plenty of time before January, so that should be handled. Can I grab a callback number in case the crew wants to confirm which drain it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure? It's 401-555-0193?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one nine three. Perfect. And that's Carol Gardiner, G-A-R-D-I-N-E-R?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:51:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes? That's right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:51:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Work order's in. If it gets worse, like water heading toward a house or the road really covered, call back right away and we'll bump it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:51:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay? And you'll put the date on it? Like, I can call and say the number and somebody can tell me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, call back with the address and they'll find it in the system. It'll show the request date and where the crew is on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:51:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay? Thank you, Kevin? I just, I hope it actually happens this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:51:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It's in the queue now. Have a good weekend, Carol."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T08:52:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too? Bye?"
    }
  ],
